00:10:08.067 --> 00:10:10.067
-You can't hear her? I know because my mute button

00:10:10.067 --> 00:10:11.667
really does work, doesn't it?

00:10:11.667 --> 00:10:14.033
-Why does yours do that?! -It's part of my contract.

00:10:14.033 --> 00:10:16.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:10:16.133 --> 00:10:18.334
-Come on, buddy. That's how you do it.

00:10:18.334 --> 00:10:20.200
Standing ovation. -Thank you.

00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:22.067
-One of my favorite guests. -Thank you.

00:10:22.067 --> 00:10:23.701
-Blake -- Look at this. A standing ovation.

00:10:23.701 --> 00:10:25.501
They want you. -For me?

00:10:25.501 --> 00:10:27.501
-They want you to leave. [ Laughs ]

00:10:27.501 --> 00:10:29.200
Blake Shelton.

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:31.167
"The Voice" premieres September 19th.

00:10:31.167 --> 00:10:32.567
He's on tour. Check him out.

00:10:32.567 --> 00:10:34.467
Gigi Hadid joins us after the break.

00:10:34.467 --> 00:10:35.968
Stick around, everybody.

